<title>MALAYSIA: NSTP amends FCW share issue terms.</title>
<headline>NSTP amends FCW share issue terms.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Straits Times Press (Malaysia) Bhd (NSTP) said on Tuesday that a proposed sale of its 20.17 percent stake in Commerce Asset-Holding Bhd to FCW Holdings Bhd will be satisfied partly by 26,913,000 new shares of FCW at 3.60 ringgit a share.</p>
<p>This is an amendment from a previously announced 21.53 million shares of new FCW shares at 4.50 ringgit a share.</p>
<p>In a statement, the publisher said the balance of the sale price, or 968 million ringgit, would be satisfied by 871.95 million in cash, the same figure as was previously announced.</p>
<p>The company did not provide a reason for the amendment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
